  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif [elles] be cwicum mannum ciricgrið abrocen beo, betan man georne be þam þe seo dæd sy, sy hit þurh feohtlac, si hit þurh reaflac, si hit þurh unriht hæmed, si þurh þæt þæt hit sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the protection of the church is broken in some other respect, without the taking of life, amends shall diligently be made in accordance with the nature of the offence, whether it be fighting or robbery or illicit intercourse or whatever it may be.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf elles be cwicum mannum cyricgrið abrocen beo, bete man georne be þam þe seo dæd sy, sy hit þurh feohtlac, sy hit þurh reaflac, sy þurh þæt þæt hit sy;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
